1942,EQ ID 1942,Forklift Battery Charger (Toyota),Fabrication,10723,"1.) Turn power off and lock out at the disconnect.
2.) Open front cover and remove top cover.
3.) Blow out the inside of the charger with compressed air.
4.) Wipe down the outside of the charger and clear any obstructions from the louvers.
5.) Make sure all screwed and bolted electrical connections are tight.
6.) Check the condition of all cables and insulation and replace if necessary.
7.) Visually inspect inside for any damage.",Pending,4/14/2024,,Technician,0.00,0.00,0.00,,,[]
