243,EQ ID 243,Press Brake #47 (WC 2013),Fabrication,163,"1.) Replace hydraulic fluid. Replace the high pressure and return line filters.
2.) Check condition of all hydraulic lines and cylinders. Flush if necessary. Remove cylinders and send for repair if needed.
3.) Check condition of electrical components/cables manually and with thermal.
4.) Check bearings and lovejoy.
5.) Check motor windings and electrical connections for motor.

***On this PM only***
If pump is still making noise, get with Warrior Industrial and set-up for pump to be picked up and rebuilt (by same company) due to the fact that warranty is still active on the rebuild from last year.",Pending,3/18/2023,,Technician,0.00,0.00,0.00,,,[]
